### Curve25519 RFC 7748 §5.2 single scalar-mult test vectors

#### TV1: scalar a546e36b... × u e6db6867... → c3da5537...

- Verify: TV1: scalar a546e36b... × u e6db6867... → c3da5537...
   - Expected: x25519(SCALAR_TV1, U_TV1) equals `EXPECTED_TV1`


