step("Verify: TV1: scalar a546e36b... × u e6db6867... → c3da5537...")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
expect(x25519(SCALAR_TV1, U_TV1)).to_equal(EXPECTED_TV1)
```

</details>

